[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3302.15, "timestamp": "00:55:02", "text": "我的嗯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3304.39, "timestamp": "00:55:04", "text": "就像“哦，是的”。呃，你觉得这是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3306.549, "timestamp": "00:55:06", "text": "好的？就像把这东西竖起来一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3309.829, "timestamp": "00:55:09", "text": "这样混合吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3316.549, "timestamp": "00:55:16", "text": "或者，我还可以采取其他什么方法呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3319.91, "timestamp": "00:55:19", "text": "德维尔森问道，就像剪贴蒙版一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3324.79, "timestamp": "00:55:24", "text": "我可以这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3327.829, "timestamp": "00:55:27", "text": "呃，它在哪儿？它以前所在的地方"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3331.109, "timestamp": "00:55:31", "text": "这里是我混合的图像，就像这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3334.549, "timestamp": "00:55:34", "text": "用圆形的东西把它弄得更圆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3336.47, "timestamp": "00:55:36", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3338.71, "timestamp": "00:55:38", "text": "那东西叫什么名字？我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3341.03, "timestamp": "00:55:41", "text": "忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3344.549, "timestamp": "00:55:44", "text": "那东西叫什么名字？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3348.95, "timestamp": "00:55:48", "text": "呃，有件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3351.51, "timestamp": "00:55:51", "text": "大约"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3353.67, "timestamp": "00:55:53", "text": "哦，对，就是这个。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3355.349, "timestamp": "00:55:55", "text": "是的。哦，我忘了。是啊，是啊，是啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3357.67, "timestamp": "00:55:57", "text": "这个。哦，是的。是的。是的。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3359.43, "timestamp": "00:55:59", "text": "他最近重新发布了它。哦，是的。"}]